{"title":"Hoe u het juiste urinoirscherm kiest","excerpt":"Een praktische gids voor het kiezen van het juiste urinoirscherm voor restaurants, benzinestations en openbare voorzieningen - over verkeer, spatbescherming, geur, ecologie en urinoirtype.","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"how-to-choose-the-right-urinal-screen"},"mainImage":{"_type":"image","alt":"Blauw antispat urinoirscherm","asset":{"_ref":"image-3699456590f9ca86dfff8e1bfab387e6aedbc818-1342x1401-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"body":[{"_key":"intro1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"intro1a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Toiletten schoon, fris en hygiënisch veilig houden is een dagelijkse uitdaging voor iedereen die een restaurant, tankstation of andere openbare voorziening exploiteert. Een van de belangrijkste, maar vaak over het hoofd geziene, details is het urinoirscherm. Deze elimineren niet alleen onaangename geuren, maar voorkomen ook dat urine terugspat, waardoor de verspreiding van urinedruppels vanaf het oppervlak van het urinoirscherm wordt verminderd. Ze leveren een belangrijke bijdrage aan de algehele hygiëne. Maar hoe kies je het juiste scherm voor jouw toiletten?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"h2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"h2-1a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"1. Houd rekening met de gebruiksfrequentie"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"De eerste stap is om te beoordelen hoe vaak uw toiletten worden gebruikt:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b1a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Restaurants, bars, luchthavens, winkelcentra"},{"_key":"b1b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - hier zijn een hoge duurzaamheid, een langdurig effect en een effectieve bescherming tegen spatten essentieel."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b2a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Minder bezochte toiletten"},{"_key":"b2b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" (bijvoorbeeld kantoren of kleinere faciliteiten) kunnen volstaan ​​met economischere oplossingen met een kortere levensduur, maar hoge hygiëne en effectieve spatbescherming moeten nog steeds een prioriteit zijn."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Aanbevelingen:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b3a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Voor toiletten met veel verkeer: "},{"_key":"b3b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"xcrën HD"},{"_key":"b3c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" of "},{"_key":"b3d","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"ëkcoscreen"},{"_key":"b3e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" (geur houdt meer dan 60 dagen aan, 95% oppervlaktedekking met borstelharen voor de meest geavanceerde spatbescherming)."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b4a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Voor standaardgebruik: "},{"_key":"b4b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"powër screen"},{"_key":"b4c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" (geur houdt 30 dagen aan, effectieve borsteltechnologie)."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b5a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Economische opties: "},{"_key":"b5b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"üro lite"},{"_key":"b5c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - geweldige prijs-kwaliteitverhouding, compact formaat, minder intense geur."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"h2-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"h2-2a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"2. Spatbescherming = minder schoonmaken, betere hygiëne"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Urine die buiten het urinoir spat is niet alleen lelijk; het kan urinedruppels verspreiden, de schoonmaakbehoefte vergroten en de hygiënische indruk verslechteren."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ëkcos producten gebruiken gepatenteerd "},{"_key":"p4b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"__MERK_SBT__"},{"_key":"p4c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", waarbij dicht op elkaar geplaatste lange borstelharen effectief urinestromen absorberen en terugspatten minimaliseren."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p5a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"TIP: "},{"_key":"p5b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Vermijd urinoirschermen zonder hoogwaardige anti-spatbescherming op borstelharenbasis als u gebruik maakt van toiletten met veel verkeer."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"h2-3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"h2-3a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"3. Geur, intensiteit en duur - Kies wat bij uw behoeften past"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Moderne schermen geven de geur geleidelijk af, waardoor de lucht rond het urinoir fris blijft. Overwegen:"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b6a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Duur: "},{"_key":"b6b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"30 dagen (maandelijkse vervanging) versus 60 dagen. Een langere geurduur verlaagt de bedrijfskosten: een urinoirscherm van 60 dagen gaat twee keer zo lang mee, maar kost niet twee keer zoveel."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b7a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Geurtypes: "},{"_key":"b7b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Populaire keuzes zijn onder meer Berry, Fresh, Citrus, Meloen, enz."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b8a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Intensiteit:"}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b8a1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b8a1t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Meest intens: Mint (zwarte kleur)."}],"level":2,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b8a2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b8a2t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Zeer intens: Fris (blauw), Citrus (geel), Den (donkergroen), Lavendel (paars)."}],"level":2,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b8a3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b8a3t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Gemiddelde intensiteit: Bes (paars), Meloen (rood)."}],"level":2,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b8a4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b8a4t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Subtiel: Tropisch Fruit (oranje), Mango (roodoranje), Appel (lichtgroen)."}],"level":2,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b9a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Kleur opties"},{"_key":"b9b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" - match met interieur of bewegwijzering (zwart is bijvoorbeeld trendy, blauw symboliseert frisheid)."}],"level":1,"listItem":"bullet","markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"h2-4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"h2-4a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"4. Ecologie wordt steeds belangrijker"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p7a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Als uw bedrijf duurzaamheid belangrijk vindt, let dan op de chemische samenstelling en biologische afbreekbaarheid van de producten."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8a","_type":"span","marks":[